0..76 Comment "// A buffer\'s region ended under its pending completion: buffers passed to a"
77..154 Comment "// read \"must remain valid until completion\" (io_uring(7)), so the region the"
155..232 Comment "// buffer lives in may not end while the submission that holds it is pending."
233..309 Comment "// The kernel is a forked peer, which no region bounds, so a submission that"
310..386 Comment "// carries a value kept in a region is refused where the kernel is forked. A"
387..460 Comment "// region is a static extent erased before anything runs (Koronkevich and"
461..539 Comment "// Bowman, _Type Universes as Kripke Worlds_, ICFP 2025, doi:10.1145/3747532)."
541..580 Comment "// The ring\'s protocol and its entries."
